{{- if .Global.Config.Published }}
### NuGet

To add the [NuGet](https://www.nuget.org/) package to a .NET project:
```bash
dotnet add package {{ getPackageId }}
```

### Locally
{{- end}}

To add a reference to a local instance of the SDK in a .NET project:
```bash
dotnet add reference {{getSDKTopLevelFolder}}/{{getPackageId}}.csproj
```